Central Instruments
- The Astro-Cello: A custom 5-string electric cello played with a bow laced with carbon-fiber needles, generating harsh, screeching overtones mixed with deep orbital sub-harmonics.
- Scraped Deathrock Guitars: Vintage offset guitars played through heavy flange, chorus, and digital delay, picked behind the bridge to simulate solar wind hiss.
- Bio-Pulse Synthesizer & Modular Strings: Analogue string synthesizer systems slaved to biological heart-rate monitors, outputting massive, frozen polyphonic pads.
- Orchestra of the Void: A quadrophonic section of 16 violins, violas, and double basses tuned down an octave, taped to vibrate against heavy iron sheets.

